    max: An optional `float`. Defaults to `6`.
    num_bits: An optional `int`. Defaults to `8`.
    narrow_range: An optional `bool`. Defaults to `False`.
    name: A name for the operation (optional).

  Returns:
    A `Tensor` of type `float32`.

